  "name": "Spiced lentil and carrot soup",
  "description": "Dry lentils simmered with carrot, onion and tomato until thick, finished with ground cumin and a spoonful of olive oil.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Warm the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and carrot and cook until softened, about 6 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin and the tomato and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lentils with enough liquid to cover them, then bring to a boil.",
    "Simmer for 20 minutes, until the lentils are tender and the carrot is soft.",
    "Blend a third of the mixture for a thicker texture, then ladle into bowls."
